msgstr "是否在光标移出 Markdown 单元格时渲染它们。"

#: /packages/notebook-extension/schema/tracker.json:/properties/autoRenderMarkdownCells/title
msgctxt "settings"
msgid "Automatically render markdown when cursor leaves markdown cells"
msgstr "当光标离开 Markdown 单元格时，自动渲染 markdown"

