msgctxt "settings"
msgid "Defines the maximum number of output cells to be rendered in the output area for cells with many outputs. The output area will have a head and the remaining outputs will be trimmed and not displayed unless the user clicks on the information message. Set to 0 to have the complete display."
msgstr "对于具有多个输出的单元格，定义其输出区域要呈现的输出单元格的最大数量。输出区域将包含一个头部和部分消息内容。只有当用户单击消息后，才会显示完整的消息。设为 0 以完全显示。"

#: /packages/notebook-extension/schema/tracker.json:/properties/maxNumberOutputs/title
msgctxt "settings"
msgid "The maximum number of output cells to be rendered in the output area."
msgstr "输出区域中输出单元格的最大数量。"

