#: /packages/notebook-extension/schema/tracker.json:/properties/windowingMode/description
msgctxt "settings"
msgid "'defer': Improve loading time - Wait for idle CPU cycles to attach out of viewport cells - 'full': Best performance with side effects - Attach to the DOM only cells in viewport - 'none': Worst performance without side effects - Attach all cells to the viewport"
msgstr "'defer': 改善加载时间 - 等待空闲 CPU 周期以附加视口外的单元格 - 'full': 最佳性能，但带有副作用 - 仅将视口内的单元格附加到 DOM 中 - 'none': 最差性能且没有副作用 - 将所有单元格都附加到视口中"

#: /packages/notebook-extension/schema/tracker.json:/properties/windowingMode/description
msgctxt "settings"
msgid "- 'defer': Improve loading time - Wait for idle CPU cycles to attach out of viewport cells\n"
"- 'full': Best performance with side effects - Attach to the DOM only cells in viewport\n"
"- 'none': Worst performance without side effects - Attach all cells to the viewport\n"
"- 'contentVisibility': Browser-optimized rendering - Use content-visibility to skip offscreen cells"
msgstr "- 'defer': 延迟附加视口外单元格以等待空闲 CPU，从而改善加载时间\n"
"- 'full': 最佳性能（有副作用）——只将视口内的单元格附加到 DOM\n"
"- 'none': 最差性能（无副作用）——将所有单元格都附加到视口\n"
"- 'contentVisibility': 浏览器优化渲染——使用 content-visibility 跳过屏幕外单元格"

